         {
          "title": "Four reasons",
          "body_md": "For extra cleansing (*uttari karan*), for atonement (*prayashchitt*), for purity (*vishodhi*) and to pull out inner thorns (*vishalli*) — so that wrong karma can be destroyed. Then: *“thami kaussaggam”* — I stand in kayotsarg.",
          "emoji": "🎯"
         },
         {
          "title": "Inner thorns (shalya)",
          "body_md": "A thorn in your foot keeps hurting until it comes out. The soul has three such thorns: hidden deceit (*maya*), wanting worldly rewards for good deeds (*niyana*) and wrong belief (*mithyatva*).",
          "emoji": "🌵"
         },
         {
          "title": "First line",
          "body_md": "*“Tassa uttari-karanenam, payachchhitta-karanenam…”*",
          "emoji": "🔤"
         }
        ],
