          "meaning": "I bow to the Siddhas, the souls that are free from every karma, forever."
         },
         {
          "text": "नमो आयरियाणं",
          "translit": "Namo Ayariyanam",
          "meaning": "I bow to the Acharyas, who lead the sangh and live the five kinds of right conduct."
         },
         {
          "text": "नमो उवज्झायाणं",
